  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Paid-in capital budget for International Finance Facility for Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The paid-in capital budget will enable the International Finance Facility for Education (IFFEd) to function as a funding mechanism focussed on Education. IFFEd will work through the Multilateral Development Banks to provide new, additional, affordable lending to partner governments for education in Lower Middle-Income Countries (LMICs).</narrative>
  </description>
